# PDFs are binary. Without this git applies its text heuristic per file, and a
# PDF whose first bytes carry no NUL is diffed and stored as text: the two
# source documents under `docs/references/` arrived that way on the branch they
# came from, one as 6068 lines of mojibake in the diff. The bytes survived, but
# the diff is unreadable and a future line-ending normalization would corrupt
# the xref offsets. Declared rather than left to the heuristic. `PL-JX2T`.
*.pdf binary
